+From c74e0716aee63a81c3a78f6103bd26e396054869 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
+Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 09:41:27 -0500
+Subject: [PATCH] server, chat : stop generating at a stray K2-Horizon close
+ tag; keep reasoning_format none raw
+
+Fleet QA round 6 (Dawn):
+- Content ended at a stray close tag, but decoding went on to EOS or
+  max_tokens: one reply was "The marker " for 300 completion tokens, with the
+  client waiting and the slot busy. Chat params carry the tags as
+  stops_after_reasoning, sent to the server as stop_after_reasoning: stop
+  strings that count only once one of them already occurred (closed the
+  reasoning). Checked with /completion: the first marker passes, generation
+  stops at the second, streamed and not (9 tokens instead of the limit).
+- With reasoning_format none, stray_ends cut the raw output at the first
+  close tag, so the reply was just "<ifm|think_faster>\n". It now applies only
+  when reasoning is extracted, and so does the stop.
+
+Assisted-by: Claude Opus 5.5
+
+(cherry picked from commit 7e2b81517; re-derived for upstream b11454: the autoparser/test-chat hunks of this patch are carried by the k2-horizon.cpp port commits)
+---
+ common/chat.h                   |  1 +
+ tools/server/server-common.cpp  |  3 +++
+ tools/server/server-context.cpp | 31 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
+ tools/server/server-schema.cpp  | 14 ++++++++++++++
+ tools/server/server-task.cpp    |  1 +
+ tools/server/server-task.h      |  1 +
+ 6 files changed, 51 insertions(+)
+
