+From 1a9f36e792b47a4a2c5a064cc81349e4bd8a4d83 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
+Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:12:10 -0500
+Subject: [PATCH] sampling: empty-reply guard/tag mask: O(1) per-candidate
+ masking
+
+apply() ran std::find over the EOG and tag id lists for every candidate (twice) on each token while armed,
+about +1.5 ms/token over a ~250k vocab. Membership is now a per-vocab flag table built at init, the
+"last candidate standing" check stops at the first other finite candidate, and when the candidates are the
