+From 0619cebbf4850c6db054e352c863f189f2ac9043 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
+From: dgabehar <dgabehar@gmail.com>
+Date: Wed, 7 Oct 2026 09:49:47 -0500
+Subject: [PATCH] tests: K2-Horizon: port the fleet's parser, history and
+ guard-field tests
+
+The fork's K2 test-chat blocks run against both the template the fleet GGUFs
+embed (models/templates/k2-horizon.jinja, kept as a fixture; md5 2aafe220,
+byte-identical to the official IFM GGUF's) and upstream's IFM-K2-Horizon.jinja.
+test_k2_guard_fields pins that the parser fills the sampler guard's inputs
+(no_empty_reply_inert/hold/open, stops_after_reasoning): a parser that stops
+filling them compiles and passes every parse test but disarms the guard.
+
+Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
